    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/c1a940a295c5090b919753fa6717f57a.poster.avif?t=1726465322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/c1a940a295c5090b919753fa6717f57a.webm?t=1726465322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/0accef0efb472026cad20291bd2f3750.poster.avif?t=1726465322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/0accef0efb472026cad20291bd2f3750.webm?t=1726465322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/0accef0efb472026cad20291bd2f3750.mp4?t=1726465322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/5738f51295e4528515db24fa6ac940f0.webp?t=1726465322\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/101cc8c2a7b07e016dccee637b0cafc4.poster.avif?t=1726465322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/101cc8c2a7b07e016dccee637b0cafc4.webm?t=1726465322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>The <strong>\u201cBubble Guy\u201d</strong> has been entrusted with the mission to dive into the depths of a terraformed world at the pleasure of deities. You will go through the different realms, bouncing off the walls, wrapping enemies in bubbles and leaving everything in your path squeaky clean. Antique civilizations await in your journey, as you meet charming characters to befriend and, most importantly, try to restore the order.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/f7a63c89ebda9e237ea3f4f90ca92180.poster.avif?t=1726465322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/f7a63c89ebda9e237ea3f4f90ca92180.webm?t=1726465322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/f7a63c89ebda9e237ea3f4f90ca92180.mp4?t=1726465322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/501a209070747c5e6e37d791243da777.webp?t=1726465322\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/101cc8c2a7b07e016dccee637b0cafc4.poster.avif?t=1726465322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/101cc8c2a7b07e016dccee637b0cafc4.webm?t=1726465322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dungeon Cleaner</strong> is a Roguelite with never-before-seen mechanics.<br>He plays the charismatic &quot;Bubble Guy&quot;, inhabitant of a world terraformed by gods after a great war.<br><br>Instead of using weapons, the Bubble Guy will bounce off the walls of the changing and mysterious dungeons while trapping enemies that cross his descent in bubbles! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/3a90e0479be59164b846bf3132bde1f0.poster.avif?t=1726465322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/3a90e0479be59164b846bf3132bde1f0.webm?t=1726465322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/3a90e0479be59164b846bf3132bde1f0.mp4?t=1726465322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/41e9e965f48f3c38f10fd04c60e1ceda.webp?t=1726465322\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/101cc8c2a7b07e016dccee637b0cafc4.poster.avif?t=1726465322\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/101cc8c2a7b07e016dccee637b0cafc4.webm?t=1726465322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced combat action using core mechanics never seen before.<br></li><li>Powerful bosses to battle and engage in bubbly friendship with.<br></li><li>Procedurally generated dungeons, Total Replayability!<br></li><li>Dozens of items, all uniquely affecting your gameplay.<br></li><li>Charismatic characters with unique designs and stories to tell.<br></li><li>The character is a bubble with legs named &quot;&quot;Bubble guy&quot;&quot;, what more do you want, good music?<br></li><li>Good music (happy?).<br></li><li>A three-dimensional beach ball (yes).</li></ul></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2295430/extras/4e92897065d79f0459db1a6186d08419.poster.avif?t=1726465322\" ><source src=\"htt